# Local AWS/Terraform state and generated files: NEVER commit.
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.tfstate.lock.info
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/terraform.tfvars
**/terraform.tfvars.json
**/*.auto.tfvars
**/*.auto.tfvars.json
**/tfplan
**/*.tfplan
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log

# Generated evidence may contain account identifiers and sensitive plan output.
evidence/terraform-plan.txt
evidence/terraform-outputs.json
evidence/*.tfplan

# Keep .terraform.lock.hcl in version control once generated/reviewed.
